    {
      "id": "cb5e1445-7698-4f3a-955b-89cbaf07311c",
      "name": "Sticky Note d7e5b17b",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -160,
        512
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 996,
        "height": 468,
        "content": "## Setup Instructions\n\n**1. Connect your credentials** (each node with a red icon needs this):\n- Gmail OAuth2 on \"New Invoice Email\"\n- AI model credentials on \"OpenRouter Model\" - this template uses OpenRouter so you can pick any model (Claude, GPT, Gemini, Llama, etc.) from one place. If you'd rather call Claude directly, swap this node for an Anthropic Chat Model node instead.\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 on both \"Add to Invoice CRM\" and \"Flag for Manual Review\"\n\n**2. Create your Google Sheet** with two tabs:\n- \"Invoice\" tab with headers: vendor_name, invoice_number, invoice_date, due_date, subtotal, tax, total_amount, currency, line_items_summary, source_email, received_date, status\n- \"Review\" tab with the same headers (for anything that fails extraction)\n\n**3. Select your sheet** in the \"Add to Invoice CRM\" and \"Flag for Manual Review\" nodes (Document + Sheet dropdowns).\n\n**4. Pick a model** on \"OpenRouter Model\" - any model you like works, since this is fully customizable to your preference.\n\n**5. Activate the workflow.** It polls Gmail every minute for new emails with PDF attachments."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "41819bc1-4514-496e-a4b2-525f4e9c7cff",
      "name": "Sticky Note e2c22e11",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -384,
        -176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 788,
        "height": 364,
        "content": "## How This Works\n\n1. Watches your inbox for new emails\n2. Splits out each PDF attachment (handles multiple invoices in one email)\n3. Skips emails with no attachments entirely - zero cost\n4. Checks each attachment is actually a PDF\n5. Extracts text from the PDF\n6. If text extraction fails (e.g. scanned image), flags it for manual review instead of guessing\n7. AI reads the invoice text and pulls structured fields (vendor, invoice #, dates, totals, etc.)\n8. Appends a clean row to your Google Sheet CRM\n\nOnly PDFs with readable text ever reach the AI step, so you're never paying for junk/spam emails."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
